    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fateful Night</strong> is a story-driven psychological horror game about four college students searching for a thrill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll experience the events through the eyes of Jim, one of the students. Along with his girlfriend and friends, he heads to an abandoned house deep in the forest \u2014 a place suggested by one of his friends, Ryan. The police had no record of the house, and the group decided to explore it before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/96e24e68ed8e6c9d4c665ad49035bef6.poster.avif?t=1746544000\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/96e24e68ed8e6c9d4c665ad49035bef6.webm?t=1746544000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/96e24e68ed8e6c9d4c665ad49035bef6.mp4?t=1746544000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a narrative walking simulator focused on atmosphere, tension, and interaction with the characters. <br>Most of the gameplay centers around dialogue and the choices you make while interacting with others. Every character responds to your words and actions, and key decisions can affect the story and the fate of your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/c9b60f595e930d4bd1a5ddad6d9e5ae0.poster.avif?t=1746544000\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/c9b60f595e930d4bd1a5ddad6d9e5ae0.webm?t=1746544000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251590/extras/c9b60f595e930d4bd1a5ddad6d9e5ae0.mp4?t=1746544000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you all make it back alive, or will some of you never reach your next exam?</strong><br>Everything will be decided on this <i>fateful night</i>.</p>",
